  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Peel the cucumber into ribbons. Finely chop the peanuts. Thinly slice the tofu. Combine the peanuts, Tex-Mex seasoning, ½ tsp white wine vinegar, 2 tsp honey and 1 tbs hot water in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062650/photos/large/181093_1-1800304e8c12460826dc84e9abf207b7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep cucumber: Whisk 2 tsp olive oil and 1 tsp white wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the cucumber and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062651/photos/large/181093_2-cea5b3d9c3dcfca6e859a85343cdbf17.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Glaze tofu: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the tofu, stirring occasionally, for 2-3 mins until golden. Add the peanut mixture and bring to a simmer. Cook, stirring, for 30 secs or until the tofu is coated. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062652/photos/large/181093_3-c41ac23710bf17cbb329a6d9f5d9d70d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tortillas: Put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through (see Kitchen 101).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062653/photos/large/181093_4-8389a0ce7a9b6c0840eca1b4ee2cb454.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Spread the tortillas with the guacamole. Fill with the drained cucumber, tofu and any pan juices, dollop with the mayonnaise and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062654/photos/large/181093_5-250b122fee605b555c903129a526a3f2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: Don't have a microwave? Enclose the tortillas in foil and put in a 220C oven for 8 mins or until softened and warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/3062655/photos/large/181093_6-9fe4d7544c0826375efa2337f87f61d0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
